meta {
  name: Get Stream Info
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{tmdbId}}/stream
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Stream Info

  Retrieves Mux playback metadata and the HLS `.m3u8` stream URL for a playable title.

  ## Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `tmdbId` | `number` | Yes | Numeric TMDB identifier of the title. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**:
    ```json
    {
      "tmdbId": 157336,
      "muxPlaybackId": "qxb01i6T202018GGSNzgwtm00hzV02M4FbdQ344Xw2bU6I",
      "muxAssetId": null,
      "availableRegions": ["US", "CA", "GB"],
      "streamUrl": "https://stream.mux.com/qxb01i6T202018GGSNzgwtm00hzV02M4FbdQ344Xw2bU6I.m3u8"
    }
    ```
  - **400 Bad Request**: `{ "error": "tmdbId must be a number" }`.
  - **404 Not Found**: `{ "error": "No playable content found for this tmdbId" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

